
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#111713">
<title>The Currency of Relationships</title>

<style>
:root {
  --bg: #111713;
  --surface: #1b241e;
  --text: #f2f0e8;
  --muted: #a6afa5;
  --gold: #d9b77c;
  --green: #9eb8a0;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.hero {
  min-height: 90vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 80px 24px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 35%, #29392d 0%, transparent 65%);
}

.eyebrow {
  color: var(--gold);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  font: 11px Arial, sans-serif;
}

h1 {
  font-size: clamp(48px, 9vw, 100px);
  font-weight: normal;
  line-height: 1.05;
  max-width: 900px;
  margin: 30px 0;
}

h1 em { color: var(--gold); }

.subtitle {
  max-width: 570px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 19px;
}

.scroll {
  margin-top: 65px;
  color: var(--gold);
  font: 11px Arial, sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
}

section {
  max-width: 1050px;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 100px 24px;
}

.section-title {
  text-align: center;
  font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
  font-weight: normal;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.section-intro {
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--muted);
  max-width: 620px;
  margin: 0 auto 55px;
}

.tokens {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
}

.token {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid #354238;
  padding: 35px 28px;
  min-height: 290px;
  transition: .3s;
}

.token:hover {
  transform: translateY(-7px);
  border-color: var(--gold);
}

.number {
  color: var(--gold);
  font: 12px Arial, sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
}

.symbol {
  font-size: 38px;
  margin: 20px 0 5px;
  color: var(--gold);
}

.token h3 {
  font-size: 29px;
  font-weight: normal;
  margin: 0 0 15px;
}

.token p {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 15px;
}

.foundation {
  background: #202c23;
  max-width: none;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 100px 24px;
}

.foundation-inner {
  max-width: 750px;
  margin: auto;
}

.foundation h2 {
  font-size: clamp(45px, 7vw, 75px);
  font-weight: normal;
  color: var(--gold);
  margin: 15px 0;
}

.foundation p {
  color: #c1c9be;
  font-size: 18px;
}

.principle {
  text-align: center;
}

.principle h2 {
  font-size: clamp(35px, 6vw, 58px);
  line-height: 1.25;
  font-weight: normal;
}

.principle h2 em { color: var(--gold); }

.exchange {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 25px;
  margin-top: 55px;
  text-align: left;
}

.exchange > div {
  border-top: 1px solid #566357;
  padding-top: 20px;
}

.exchange h3 {
  font-size: 24px;
  font-weight: normal;
}

.exchange p { color: var(--muted); }

.quote {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 110px 24px;
  background: #202c23;
}

.quote blockquote {
  max-width: 850px;
  margin: auto;
  font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 52px);
  line-height: 1.35;
}

.quote strong {
  color: var(--gold);
  font-weight: normal;
}

footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 45px 20px;
  color: #829083;
  font: 11px Arial, sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}

@media(max-width: 700px) {
  .tokens { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .token { min-height: auto; }
  .exchange { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  section { padding: 75px 22px; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="eyebrow">A philosophy of human connection</div>

  <h1>The Currency of <em>Relationships.</em></h1>

  <p class="subtitle">
    Every relationship is an investment.
    And every investment requires something of value.
    There are three currencies we all spend.
  </p>

  <div class="scroll">THREE CURRENCIES · ONE FOUNDATION ↓</div>
</header>

<section>
  <h2 class="section-title">The three tokens</h2>

  <p class="section-intro">
    We all have limited resources. How we choose to invest
    them says a lot about the relationships we build.
  </p>

  <div class="tokens">

    <article class="token">
      <div class="number">01 — CURRENCY</div>
      <div class="symbol">◷</div>
      <h3>Time</h3>
      <p>
        Your most limited and non-refundable resource.
        Making time, being present, showing up, initiating
        plans and making someone a priority.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="token">
      <div class="number">02 — CURRENCY</div>
      <div class="symbol">✧</div>
      <h3>Energy</h3>
      <p>
        The emotional and mental effort you invest.
        Listening, caring, communicating, showing affection,
        supporting someone and resolving conflict.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="token">
      <div class="number">03 — CURRENCY</div>
      <div class="symbol">◇</div>
      <h3>Money</h3>
      <p>
        The financial resources you are willing to share.
        Dates, gifts, experiences, helping when needed
        and sharing life's responsibilities.
      </p>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<div class="foundation">
  <div class="foundation-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow">The non-negotiable</div>
    <h2>Respect.</h2>
    <p>
      Respect is not a fourth currency.
      It is the foundation upon which all three currencies
      must be exchanged.
    </p>
    <p>
      It means valuing someone's time, recognising their
      efforts, respecting their boundaries, being honest,
      and never taking their investment for granted.
    </p>
    <p>
      Respect isn't something you earn by investing enough.
      It is the minimum standard that makes the investment
      worthwhile.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="principle">
  <div class="eyebrow">The investment principle</div>

  <h2>
    You cannot continuously <em>withdraw</em>
    without making deposits.
  </h2>

  <p class="section-intro">
    Relationships aren't necessarily 50/50 every day.
    Sometimes one person has more to give than the other.
    Life happens. Circumstances change.
  </p>

  <div class="exchange">
    <div>
      <h3>Investment</h3>
      <p>
        Someone might have little money but give plenty
        of time and emotional energy. Someone else might
        have limited time but contribute in other ways.
        The currencies don't need to be identical.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3>Reciprocity</h3>
      <p>
        What matters is mutual willingness.
        Both people should want to contribute,
        appreciate what the other brings and make
        an effort to keep the relationship alive.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="quote">
  <blockquote>
    A healthy relationship isn't about counting tokens.
    It's about making sure you're not the only one
    <strong>putting them into circulation.</strong>
  </blockquote>
</div>

<section class="principle">
  <div class="eyebrow">One last thought</div>
  <h2>
    You cannot expect a return on an investment
    you're unwilling to <em>make.</em>
  </h2>
  <p class="section-intro">
    Connection requires contribution.
    Intimacy requires emotional energy.
    Togetherness requires time.
    Shared experiences require resources.
    And all of it requires respect.
  </p>
</section>

<footer>
  THE CURRENCY OF RELATIONSHIPS · AN EXERCISE IN RECIPROCITY
</footer>

</body>
</html>
